Third-party and template code
- octos_stdio.py: stdio driver for the Octos agent kernel, taken from the Arc-Bench Octos
  agent template / octos-arc (https://github.com/octos-org/octos-arc, Apache License 2.0).
- arcbench_agent_runtime/: runtime helpers shipped with the Arc-Bench agent submission
  templates. Included unchanged; rights remain with their original authors.
- The Octos binary is not included. octos_feature.py downloads it at run time from the
  octos-arc GitHub releases.
